Sends the domains resolved by Unbound DNS (names only, never client
addresses) to a shopguard-worker container on the local network, which
scores them for signs of fake online shops: domain age and history,
certificate, hosting, legal notice and company identifiers, page content.
Domains above the chosen score are shown in the interface and, in
blocking mode, added to the Unbound blocklist.

